    {"id":"p_diab_label","type":"text","x":666,"y":222,"width":284,"height":14,"angle":0,"strokeColor":"#7f1d1d","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"groupIds":[],"frameId":null,"roundness":null,"seed":742,"version":1,"versionNonce":742,"isDeleted":false,"boundElements":null,"updated":1749000000000,"link":null,"locked":false,"text":"Kondisi DIABETES (hiperglikemia):","fontSize":11,"fontFamily":2,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","baseline":9,"containerId":null,"originalText":"Kondisi DIABETES (hiperglikemia):","lineHeight":1.25},
    {"id":"p_diab_t","type":"text","x":666,"y":238,"width":284,"height":104,"angle":0,"strokeColor":"#7f1d1d","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"groupIds":[],"frameId":null,"roundness":null,"seed":743,"version":1,"versionNonce":743,"isDeleted":false,"boundElements":null,"updated":1749000000000,"link":null,"locked":false,"text":"• Gula darah tinggi → glukosa saliva ↑\n• Bakteri oral memfermentasikan\n  glukosa berlebih → asam laktat ↑\n• Kapasitas buffer bikarbonat menurun\n  (hiposalivasi diabetik)\n• Hasil: pH saliva TURUN → lebih asam\n  (pH < 6,8 pada kondisi berat)\n• OCP IrOx bergeser ke nilai lebih\n  negatif (deteksi otomatis)","fontSize":11,"fontFamily":1,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","baseline":9,"containerId":null,"originalText":"• Gula darah tinggi → glukosa saliva ↑\n• Bakteri oral memfermentasikan\n  glukosa berlebih → asam laktat ↑\n• Kapasitas buffer bikarbonat menurun\n  (hiposalivasi diabetik)\n• Hasil: pH saliva TURUN → lebih asam\n  (pH < 6,8 pada kondisi berat)\n• OCP IrOx bergeser ke nilai lebih\n  negatif (deteksi otomatis)","lineHeight":1.5},

    {"id":"p_flow_box","type":"rectangle","x":658,"y":358,"width":300,"height":164,"angle":0,"strokeColor":"#0369a1","backgroundColor":"#dbeafe","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"groupIds":[],"frameId":null,"roundness":{"type":3},"seed":744,"version":1,"versionNonce":744,"isDeleted":false,"boundElements":null,"updated":1749000000000,"link":null,"locked":false},
    {"id":"p_flow_label","type":"text","x":666,"y":362,"width":284,"height":14,"angle":0,"strokeColor":"#0c4a6e","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"groupIds":[],"frameId":null,"roundness":null,"seed":745,"version":1,"versionNonce":745,"isDeleted":false,"boundElements":null,"updated":1749000000000,"link":null,"locked":false,"text":"Alur Perhitungan pH di ESP32-S3:","fontSize":11,"fontFamily":2,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","baseline":9,"containerId":null,"originalText":"Alur Perhitungan pH di ESP32-S3:","lineHeight":1.25},
    {"id":"p_flow_t","type":"text","x":666,"y":378,"width":284,"height":136,"angle":0,"strokeColor":"#0c4a6e","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"groupIds":[],"frameId":null,"roundness":null,"seed":746,"version":1,"versionNonce":746,"isDeleted":false,"boundElements":null,"updated":1749000000000,"link":null,"locked":false,"text":"① Baca V_OCP dari ADS1115 (mV)\n② Baca suhu T dari sensor NTC (°C)\n③ Hitung slope koreksi:\n   S(T) = −0,1984 × (T + 273,15)\n④ Hitung pH:\n   pH = (V_OCP − V_ref) / S(T)\n       + pH_ref\n   (V_ref dan pH_ref dari kalibrasi\n    buffer pH 6,8 atau 7,4)\n⑤ Output pH ke OLED & kirim ke\n   Web Platform via WiFi","fontSize":11,"fontFamily":1,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","baseline":9,"containerId":null,"originalText":"① Baca V_OCP dari ADS1115 (mV)\n② Baca suhu T dari sensor NTC (°C)\n③ Hitung slope koreksi:\n   S(T) = −0,1984 × (T + 273,15)\n④ Hitung pH:\n   pH = (V_OCP − V_ref) / S(T)\n       + pH_ref\n   (V_ref dan pH_ref dari kalibrasi\n    buffer pH 6,8 atau 7,4)\n⑤ Output pH ke OLED & kirim ke\n   Web Platform via WiFi","lineHeight":1.5}
  ]
}
